      "definition": "(D) As used in this section, \"local law enforcement representatives\" means representatives of the sheriffs of this state, representatives of the municipal chiefs of police and marshals of this state, and representatives of the township constables and chiefs of police of the township police departments or police district police forces of this state.\n\nLast updated January 1, 2025 at 7:23 AM",
